## Outstanding Questions
How can the structural stability of metal– organic frameworks be increased, both thermally and chemically?
What are the new strategies to further enhance the catalytic activity of MOFs?
Can MOFs be used as solid catalysts for the large-scale, industrial synthesis of fine chemicals?
Can powerful synergies among complementary sites can be established, so that MOFs can become efficient multifunctional catalysts?
Can MOFs act as electrocatalysts with comparable efficiency as that of noble metals?
Can MOFs be designed to be efficient photocatalysts for overall water splitting or artificial photosynthesis?
Are 2D MOFs superior to 3D MOFs?
Do methodologies to further increase the activity in 3D MOFs also apply for 2D MOFs?
Can we find better characterization and reliable synthesis for defective MOFs?
